WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.562 --> 00:00:11.504
- Weird, it's been 10 minutes

00:00:11.504 --> 00:00:14.750
since Justin said he'd
be here in 10 minutes.

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:16.119
Maybe he's just running late.

00:00:16.119 --> 00:00:19.178
You know, he does that,
he loses track of time.

00:00:19.178 --> 00:00:21.439
He does that quite a lot.

00:00:21.439 --> 00:00:24.815
Wait, did he say, be there in 10 or at 10?

00:00:24.815 --> 00:00:27.967
It's eight right now,
am I two hours early?

00:00:27.967 --> 00:00:29.847
Or did he mean 10 AM because in that case

00:00:29.847 --> 00:00:32.930
I'm 14 hours early, or 10 hours late.

00:00:34.496 --> 00:00:36.831
No, that's ridiculous, he's coming.

00:00:36.831 --> 00:00:39.155
Unless something bad happened to him.

00:00:39.155 --> 00:00:40.439
What if he choked on a cashew?

00:00:40.439 --> 00:00:42.371
You know that's his favorite nut.

00:00:42.371 --> 00:00:46.987
He probably threw one
up in the air, and gosh.

00:00:46.987 --> 00:00:48.819
He was my best friend.

00:00:48.819 --> 00:00:51.617
I'm gonna miss him so, so much.

00:00:51.617 --> 00:00:53.375
Unless he met someone and fell in love.

00:00:53.375 --> 00:00:54.918
In that case, good for you.

00:00:54.918 --> 00:00:56.916
Maybe you just forgot about
your good old best friend,

00:00:56.916 --> 00:00:59.007
'cause you're spending too
much time being in love.

00:00:59.007 --> 00:01:01.466
Maybe he just booked tickets
to take his new lover

00:01:01.466 --> 00:01:04.191
to a sexy get away to Havana, Cuba.

00:01:04.191 --> 00:01:06.312
He knows that I've been
wanting to go to Havana

00:01:06.312 --> 00:01:09.765
ever since we both watched Dirty
Dancing Two, Havana Nights.

00:01:09.765 --> 00:01:12.044
Or maybe this is The Truman Show.

00:01:12.044 --> 00:01:15.227
You know the 1998 cult
classic about Jim Carey

00:01:15.227 --> 00:01:18.575
being the star of a reality
show without even knowing it?

00:01:18.575 --> 00:01:21.074
Living a life of lies where
everyone surrounded around him

00:01:21.074 --> 00:01:22.074
is an actor?

00:01:23.063 --> 00:01:24.736
Justin's probably late
because he's too busy

00:01:24.736 --> 00:01:26.324
practicing his lines.

00:01:26.324 --> 00:01:27.490
- I'm your friend.

00:01:27.490 --> 00:01:28.920
Zack, I'm your friend.

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:30.302
- I mean look at the
people here in this bar.

00:01:30.302 --> 00:01:31.707
Look at this bartender.

00:01:31.707 --> 00:01:33.202
She's not real.

00:01:33.202 --> 00:01:35.011
She's completely doing everything wrong.

00:01:35.011 --> 00:01:36.411
She's totally an actress.

00:01:36.411 --> 00:01:39.638
Hey, I'm onto you, I know you're an actor.

00:01:39.638 --> 00:01:42.305
- Uh, so is everyone else in LA.

00:01:43.776 --> 00:01:44.609
- You're right.

00:01:44.609 --> 00:01:46.136
Or maybe he has short term memory loss

00:01:46.136 --> 00:01:47.469
and he's been trying to hide it from me

00:01:47.469 --> 00:01:48.923
for the past couple of years.

00:01:48.923 --> 00:01:51.934
Every 20 minutes he has to
look at a series of pictures

00:01:51.934 --> 00:01:55.651
with titles on them to remind
him who his real friends are.

00:01:55.651 --> 00:01:57.717
Maybe he lost the picture with me on it,

00:01:57.717 --> 00:02:00.467
and now I'm just a nobody to him.

00:02:02.315 --> 00:02:05.291
(cell phone alerts)

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:07.030
Oh, traffic, traffic of course.

00:02:07.030 --> 00:02:08.739
He's in traffic.

00:02:08.739 --> 00:02:10.228
My friend's in traffic,
I'm not here alone.

00:02:10.228 --> 00:02:11.783
Don't worry, he's in traffic.

00:02:11.783 --> 00:02:13.107
How's the whole acting thing going?

00:02:13.107 --> 00:02:13.940
Good?

